# Quad9

## Introduction

[Quad9](https://quad9.net/) is a service to block IP addresses known to distribute malware

## Installation
The following changes are needed

### Firefox Settings

* Change Datenschutz/Sicherheit -> Advanced/Erweitert -> DNS über HTTP : Changed from Standard to Off/Aus

### Gnome Settings

The *gnome-control-center* cannot run under sway. Exit sway and start a Gnome session!! (The sway-gnome package is 2026 not yet available for Debian!!!)

* Change Gnome Settings -> Network -> Kabelgebunden -> IPV4 -> from Automatic to the [quad9 settings](https://quad9.net/de/service/service-addresses-and-features/)
* Change Gnome Settings -> Network -> Kabelgebunden -> IPV6 -> from Automatic to the [quad9 settings](https://quad9.net/de/service/service-addresses-and-features/)


## Check whether active

Use [https://on.quad9.net](https://on.quad9.net/) 
